   "history": [
    {
     "status": "approved",
     "at": "2026-11-02T13:53:31+00:00",
     "note": "[consider] Keep the question form: 'says in his heart: shall a child be born to a man of a hundred, and shall Sarah, at ninety, bear?' (GEN.17.17: \"Shall a child be born unto him that is an hundred years old? and shall Sarah, that is ninety years old, bear?\")",
