    "run": "main"
   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T13:51:57+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "17:21 ('at this set time next year') is fulfilled by the birth of Isaac in Gen 21; that chapter's session writes the FULFILLS_PROPHECY link. Verse 22 (God goes up) is merged into this event as its closing beat."
   ],
   "history": [
